---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const siteBase = Astro.site!.origin;

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: `${siteBase}/` },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Shipping', item: `${siteBase}/shipping` },
  ],
};

const lastUpdated = 'August 10, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Shipping Policy | Curated Threads Outdoors"
  description="Shipping policy for Curated Threads Outdoors: free US shipping, 2 to 5 business days production, 3 to 8 business days transit, and how tracking works."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />

  <section class="border-b border-gold/30 bg-parchment px-6 py-16 text-center sm:py-20">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-gold">Support</p>
    <h1 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl text-sepia sm:text-5xl">Shipping Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink/60">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12 text-ink/85">
    <p class="mb-8">
      Every Curated Threads Outdoors order ships free within the United States. Orders are placed,
      produced, and fulfilled through our Etsy shop under the terms below. Questions about a
      specific order are best sent through
      <a href="https://curatedthreadsllc.etsy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-forest underline">Etsy messaging</a>
      so it stays with the order.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-sepia">Free US shipping on every order</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Shipping is free to the 50 US states, no minimum. There is no expedited shipping option
          today, so please plan gift orders accordingly and check the estimated delivery date
          shown at checkout on Etsy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-sepia">Production time</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Every apparel item, mug, tumbler, and glass is made to order after you check out. Typical
          production time is 2 to 5 business days. Larger orders and personalized items may take a
          day or two longer, and we'll note it in the listing if that applies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-sepia">Transit time</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          After production, most orders arrive within 3 to 8 business days in the United States.
          Delivery times can be longer during peak seasons (November through late December, and
          around major holidays). Etsy shows a delivery estimate at checkout that is specific to
          your zip code, and that estimate is the most accurate one to plan around.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-sepia">Tracking</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Every order includes tracking. As soon as your item ships, Etsy sends the tracking number
          to the email on your Etsy account, and you can also find it in your Etsy order history
          under
          <em>You &rarr; Purchases and reviews</em>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-sepia">Multiple items in one order</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Different products may be produced at different partner facilities. When that happens,
          they can ship in separate packages and arrive on different days. Each package gets its
          own tracking number, and every one still ships free.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-sepia">Where we ship</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Free shipping applies to all 50 US states, including Alaska and Hawaii. We do not
          currently ship to international addresses, PO Boxes, or APO/FPO/DPO addresses. If that
          changes, we'll update this page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-sepia">Lost, delayed, or damaged in transit</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          If your package tracking hasn't moved in 10+ business days after it shipped, or if it
          arrives damaged, message us on
          <a href="https://curatedthreadsllc.etsy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-forest underline">Etsy</a>
          with your order number. We'll open a claim with the carrier and either reship or refund.
          See our
          <a href="/returns" class="text-forest underline">Returns and Exchanges</a>
          page for the full defect and damage policy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-sepia">Address changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          If you need to change the shipping address on an order, message us as soon as possible.
          We can usually update it while the order is still in production. Once an order ships, the
          address can't be changed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-sepia">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Anything not covered here, message us on
          <a href="https://curatedthreadsllc.etsy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-forest underline">Etsy</a>
          or email
          <a href="mailto:curatedthreadsoutdoors@gmail.com" class="text-forest underline">curatedthreadsoutdoors@gmail.com</a>.
          We respond within one business day.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
